        },
        {
            "text": "a mobile device (except in the following territories which are excluded: Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan, South Korea, Vietnam, Thailand, Malaysia, Indonesia, Philippines, Singapore, Laos, Brunei, Myanmar, Cambodia, and East Timor) you are contracting with Activision Blizzard International LLC of 2701 Olympic Blvd., Building B, Santa Monica, California 90404",
